:: R3-Choice-Silent [release3]
<<set $jessCloseness -= 1>>
<<set $suspicion += 2>>
<<set $r3FirstMeetingChoice to "silent">>
You say nothing. Nod. Finish the pizza.

Jess watches you for a beat. Then fills the silence herself. //"It'll be great for us. You'll see."// The you'll see is for her as much as for you.

<div class="pt-hud-line"><span>Jess Closeness</span><b>-1</b></div>
<div class="pt-hud-line"><span>Suspicion</span><b>+2</b></div>

